  "warehouse_tables": "total tables in the warehouse (24 real + noise at dose)",
  "raw_tokens": "sum of total_tokens over all turns, all questions",
  "cache_adjusted_tokens": "(prompt - cached) + 0.1*cached + completion; cache-hit input weighted at 0.1 per DeepSeek published pricing ratio",
  "db_queries": "tool calls that execute against the database: run_query+run_file for SQL legs, `trilogy run` (and `file write --run`) for enriched legs \u2014 explore/agent-info/file read the semantic model, not the DB",
  "pass_count": "reference-checked correct answers out of questions"
 },
 "caveats": [
  "SF=1 DuckDB: probes cost milliseconds locally; the probe axis matters economically on cloud warehouses (per-query latency floors, per-scan billing), not here.",
  "Enriched accuracy swung 16<->20 across byte-identical replicates; per-cell accuracy deltas under ~4 passes are noise at n=20.",
  "Probe weight is asymmetric: bare-discovery probes skew to cheap information_schema pagination; each enriched run carries ~1.6s p50 client-side compile.",
  "Enriched legs are dose-independent by construction (agent never sees the noisy schema); plot as a horizontal reference against dose sweeps.",
  "Confusable legs from run 20260812-153111 are the v1 treatment (trap tables undocumented \u2014 a since-closed information bleed); do not compare v2 confusable runs against them cell-to-cell."
 ],
